{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02773","headline":"至望喜瞩目言怀贻剑外知己 · 卢照邻","name":"至望喜瞩目言怀贻剑外知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣图夷九折，神化掩三分。\n缄愁赴蜀道，题拙奉虞薰。\n隐辚度深谷，遥褭上高云。\n碧流递萦注，青山互纠纷。\n涧松咽风绪，岩花濯露文。\n思北常依驭，图南每丧羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}